If it clanks, call the repairman.<br><br>
If it whistles, ignore it.<br><br>
If it is a friend, take a break.<br><br>
If it is the boss, look busy.<br><br>
If it talks, take notes.<br><br>
If it is handwritten, type it.<br><br>
If it is typed, copy it.<br><br>
If it is copied, file it.<br><br>
If it is Friday, forget it!
